 ## How it works
-The method traverses a Sparse Voxel Octree (SVO) stored in a linear block structure. It initializes a ray for each pixel, pushes the root node onto a stack, and iteratively processes nodes until a leaf voxel is hit or the stack is empty [S1, S2, unofficial].
